(7599222, 1227200, 173844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Judi, on taking the blue for this charming picture.  Terrific in black and white, and what a winsome look from the dog.</td>', 'Congratulations, Judi, on taking the blue for this charming picture.  Terrific in black and white, and what a winsome look from the dog.', '2018-10-22 18:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599224, 1227382, 173844, '<td valign="top">A dizzying image of a modern day Prometheus who seems to be on the verge of sliding back down the flattened staircase.  It has strong lines and perspective, and a starkness of lighting and detail.  Strong.</td>', 'A dizzying image of a modern day Prometheus who seems to be on the verge of sliding back down the flattened staircase.  It has strong lines and perspective, and a starkness of lighting and detail.  Strong.', '2018-10-22 18:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599225, 1227401, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really fine image, Rachel.  Congratulations on the yellow.  The title is perfect.  A visceral feeling in the pit of the stomach.  The "fibers" appear to be pulling apart as it tries to forestall the oncoming conflagration (my interpretation).  To me it conveys courage, pathos and nobility.</td>', 'Really fine image, Rachel.  Congratulations on the yellow.  The title is perfect.  A visceral feeling in the pit of the stomach.  The "fibers" appear to be pulling apart as it tries to forestall the oncoming conflagration (my interpretation).  To me it conveys courage, pathos and nobility.', '2018-10-22 18:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599226, 1227396, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, eccentric and whimsical.  This clover of an old battlement, or something, of a hot air balloon is certainly aloft, physics be damned, and you''re now bound on an astounding adventure.  It''s a wistful, beautiful fantasy.</td>', 'Lovely image, eccentric and whimsical.  This clover of an old battlement, or something, of a hot air balloon is certainly aloft, physics be damned, and you''re now bound on an astounding adventure.  It''s a wistful, beautiful fantasy.', '2018-10-22 18:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599227, 1226715, 173844, '<td valign="top">Now here''s a wonderful pair of rose-colored glasses, rediscovered by imagination, patiently waiting for that right person to come along.  I know I didn''t notice them on my several recent passes along the High Line.  And as Don noted, a handsome composition.  <br/>Fine image.</td>', 'Now here''s a wonderful pair of rose-colored glasses, rediscovered by imagination, patiently waiting for that right person to come along.  I know I didn''t notice them on my several recent passes along the High Line.  And as Don noted, a handsome composition.  Fine image.', '2018-10-22 18:47:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599231, 1227294, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a great image, seemingly done in chalk.  As I''ve watched it unfold, I find that it conveys more information than most of the portraits I''ve seen.  It''s a fleeting afterimage that illuminates a life''s essence.  One of your 8''s, and a piddling rating at that.</td>', 'What a great image, seemingly done in chalk.  As I''ve watched it unfold, I find that it conveys more information than most of the portraits I''ve seen.  It''s a fleeting afterimage that illuminates a life''s essence.  One of your 8''s, and a piddling rating at that.', '2018-10-22 18:56:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599233, 1227413, 173844, '<td valign="top">Startling, affecting and beguiling.  The delicacy and coloration of the foliage are enchanting.  Here''s the world whispering to you as you fall into sleep.  The 8.</td>', 'Startling, affecting and beguiling.  The delicacy and coloration of the foliage are enchanting.  Here''s the world whispering to you as you fall into sleep.  The 8.', '2018-10-22 19:04:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599234, 1227393, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific image.  You''ve done so much with seemingly so little it''s like a sleight of hand.  The contrasts, both strong and subtle, play out like a movement in a symphony.  The lighting, along with the time of day, imparts an emotional shove.  A personal co-favorite of the challenge. 9.</td>', 'Terrific image.  You''ve done so much with seemingly so little it''s like a sleight of hand.  The contrasts, both strong and subtle, play out like a movement in a symphony.  The lighting, along with the time of day, imparts an emotional shove.  A personal co-favorite of the challenge. 9.', '2018-10-22 19:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599258, 1227422, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, mesmerizing image of this bird (cormorant?) seemingly emerging from the bedrock (ok, strange way to put it) of its environment.  It still carries the glitter on its back and appears to trail its wing tip across the water.  It''s the deep affinity of bird and water that I find to be mystical.  Moving.  9.</td>', 'Beautiful, mesmerizing image of this bird (cormorant?) seemingly emerging from the bedrock (ok, strange way to put it) of its environment.  It still carries the glitter on its back and appears to trail its wing tip across the water.  It''s the deep affinity of bird and water that I find to be mystical.  Moving.  9.', '2018-10-22 22:25:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599259, 1227250, 173844, '<td valign="top">What both Don and Anita said, surely.  A visual poem set to music.  Delicate and complex.  45 out of 48?  Never mind, it''s pure artistry.</td>', 'What both Don and Anita said, surely.  A visual poem set to music.  Delicate and complex.  45 out of 48?  Never mind, it''s pure artistry.', '2018-10-22 22:30:38.000000', NULL, 0),
