(7599396, 1227200, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now, here is an image with a gentle zig-zag feeling. The b&amp;w adds a special flavor with the light and dark tones to hold the subject matter in the eye of the beholder. Congratulations on a well derserved blue.</td>', 'Now, here is an image with a gentle zig-zag feeling. The b&w adds a special flavor with the light and dark tones to hold the subject matter in the eye of the beholder. Congratulations on a well derserved blue.', '2018-10-24 16:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599397, 1227362, 22734, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a beautiful vanishing point or better a vanishing state. A point would be too sharp. I have a weakness for this type of image. It leaves my mind wondering about what lies ahead. A very well executed image. Congratulations on your effort to score the red.</td>', 'Oh, what a beautiful vanishing point or better a vanishing state. A point would be too sharp. I have a weakness for this type of image. It leaves my mind wondering about what lies ahead. A very well executed image. Congratulations on your effort to score the red.', '2018-10-24 17:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599399, 1227370, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very rich interplay of the warmer tones. Intriguing to look at. Congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'A very rich interplay of the warmer tones. Intriguing to look at. Congratulations on your ribbon.', '2018-10-24 17:06:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599400, 1227401, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very fascinating image where one seeks subject resolution. It has an abstract flavor. Congrats on your 3rd placing.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-10-24 16:10:41.</i></td>', 'A very fascinating image where one seeks subject resolution. It has an abstract flavor. Congrats on your 3rd placing.', '2018-10-24 17:09:00.000000', '2018-10-24 17:10:41.000000', 0),
(7599401, 1227046, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image has a very soothing feel on the finer senses. Very well done. Congrats on your top five placing.</td>', 'This image has a very soothing feel on the finer senses. Very well done. Congrats on your top five placing.', '2018-10-24 17:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7599402, 1227423, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good composition. Of course, the subject gives you a lot to work with, but you made the right selection to create a good effect. Quiet beauty. Congrats on top 10 finish.</td>', 'A very good composition. Of course, the subject gives you a lot to work with, but you made the right selection to create a good effect. Quiet beauty. Congrats on top 10 finish.', '2018-10-24 17:20:30.000000', NULL, 0),
